{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   - This is **Phase 1 of 2 — PLANNING**. I am the planning agent and must NOT write any implementation code. A separate implementation agent runs next in a fresh session inheriting ONLY `/workspace/PLAN.md`, so PLAN.md must be concrete and self-contained.\n   - **Deliverable**: Produce `/workspace/PLAN.md` with exactly three sections:\n     1. **Engine gaps** — a table `| Capability needed | Smallest change | Engine file / seam | Cards that reuse it |`, preferring ONE shared seam reused by several cards over per-card subsystems.\n     2. **Per-card plan** — for each card: oracle clauses, nearest FDN analogue (`cards/fdn/<id>`) to mirror, exact engine seam(s) to reuse, any new engine change (referencing the gap table), and key edge cases worth a test.\n     3. **Implementation order** — ordered list grouping cards by shared seam, building foundational engine work first, simplest→hardest, with one-line rationale per group.\n   - **Underlying task being planned**: Implement SOS cards 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257 in `/workspace/cards/sos/`. Each has `card_spec.json` and a `card_impl.py` stub. Use FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as examples; refer to `RULEBOOK.txt` for rules. Engine changes for new keywords/mechanics are expected.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG rules engine in pure Python (stdlib only), imported as `engine`.\n   - Card hierarchy: `GameObject` → `CardImpl` → `Creature`/`Instant`/`Sorcery`/`Enchantment`/`Aura`/`Artifact`/`ArtifactCreature`/`Planeswalker`/`Land`.\n   - Hook methods: `can_cast`, `cost_reduction(game)->int`, `on_cast`, `on_resolve`, `get_targets`, `register_triggers`, `register_replacement_effects`, `get_activated_abilities`, `get_modes`, `get_loyalty_abilities` (Planeswalker), `get_mana_abilities` (Land).\n   - Triggered abilities: `TriggerManager.register(TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition, effect, source, controller))` + `fire_event`; typed events in events.py; APNAP ordering.\n   - Replacement effects: `ReplacementManager`, `move_to_zone` consults them for zone-change redirection (`destination` strings \"graveyard\"/\"exile\"/\"hand\"/\"library\", `prevented` flag).\n   - Continuous effects: `EffectManager` + `ContinuousEffect(source, layer, sublayer, apply, duration)`, 7-layer system, `DURATION_END_OF_TURN`/`DURATION_PERMANENT`.\n   - Mana: `ManaCost.parse`, `cost_reduction` reduces generic only (clamped ≥0); `colors_spent` set on card during cast; `mana_pool.last_payment_colors` for Converge.\n   - Casting: `cast_spell`, `cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone)`, `copy_spell` (stack.py).\n   - Loyalty: `LoyaltyAbilityInstance`, `activate_ability`, sorcery-speed + once-per-turn enforced; effects read targets via `_resolve_target`/`chosen_targets`.\n   - Extra/skip turns: `GameState.extra_turns: list[int]` FIFO queue, popped in `advance_phase`; `_normal_next_index` tracks normal rotation.\n   - Combat: `AttacksTriggeredEvent` fired on attack; `declare_attackers_step`; `_can_block`/`_can_attack`.\n   - Testing: `DeterministicPlayer` (FIFO script), test_utils helpers (`create_game`, `set_board_state`, `cast_spell`, `advance_to_phase`, `declare_attackers`, `declare_blockers`); max 30 tests per card.\n   - Mechanics needed: Converge, Affinity, Reach, Surveil, Casualty, Miracle, Paradigm (novel), Prepared (novel), counterspell, coin-flip, skip-turns, land animation (becomes-a-creature), spell-cast triggers.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/AGENTS.md` — Hard rules: card location invariant; engine_tests/ and FDN tests.py read-only; additive-only engine modifications (no rename/move/delete); SOS tests go at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py`.\n   - `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md` — Directory layout; FDN cards with tests.py: `fdn_13, fdn_142, fdn_205, fdn_215, fdn_244`; bare package imports.\n   - SOS card_spec.json files (all 10 read) — oracle text and complexity tiers captured in analysis above.\n   - `/workspace/engine/card.py` — `cost_reduction(game)` returns generic reduction; `Creature` has `modified_power/toughness`, `power`/`toughness` properties, `_reset_characteristics`, `_cant_be_blocked`, `protections`; `Planeswalker.get_loyalty_abilities()`; `Land.get_mana_abilities()`, `Land.can_cast` returns False.\n   - `/workspace/engine/events.py` — `SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell, player, card, controller)`, `AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature, attacker)`, `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent`, `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent`, `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent` (with subclasses, `destination`/`prevented`).\n   - `/workspace/engine/casting.py` — `cast_spell` pipeline (timing→can_cast→hand→stack→targets→cost reduction→pay→on_cast→push); stores `card.colors_spent`; `cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone)`; `_resolve_spell` sets `card.chosen_targets`. **NOTE: cast_spell does NOT fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent.**\n   - `/workspace/engine/stack.py` — `StackObject(source, controller, targets, on_resolve, is_mana_ability)`; `copy_spell(game, original, controller, new_targets=None)`; `priority_loop`.\n   - `/workspace/engine/zones.py` — `move_to_zone` (replacement redirection, ETB/LTB triggers, register/unregister); `move_zone`.\n   - `/workspace/engine/game.py` — helpers: `deal_damage`, `destroy`, `sacrifice`, `exile`, `draw_card`, `discard`, `create_token`, `add_counter`, `remove_counter`, `tap`, `untap`.\n   - `/workspace/engine/game_state.py` — `extra_turns` FIFO, `advance_phase` pops extra turns; `_normal_next_index`.\n   - `/workspace/engine/abilities.py` — `activate_ability`, `LoyaltyAbilityInstance` (sorcery-speed, once-per-turn), `ActivatedAbilityInstance`, `tap_cost`.\n   - `/workspace/engine/combat.py` — `AttacksTriggeredEvent`, `declare_attackers_step`,