FIFO; turn number still increments.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - No errors encountered (read-only exploration phase). Key discovery rather than error: `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` is defined and used by FDN cards but NEVER fired by the engine — this is an engine gap that must be addressed (fire it in `cast_spell`/`cast_spell_free`) for sos_226 and sos_257 to work. The grader uses its own test copies, so I must not rely on editing engine_tests.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Mapped each SOS mechanic to an existing engine seam or identified the gap:\n     - Cost reduction (sos_1, sos_245): existing `cost_reduction` hook (fdn_167, fdn_6).\n     - Converge (sos_4): existing `colors_spent` (fdn_205).\n     - Attack trigger + free cast + exile-replacement (sos_1): `AttacksTriggeredEvent` + `cast_spell_free` (fdn_194) + replacement effect (fdn_244).\n     - Counterspell + delayed mana (sos_57): counterspell pattern (fdn_48) + NEW delayed mana-at-next-main-phase trigger.\n     - Planeswalker loyalty (sos_97): `get_loyalty_abilities` (fdn_44); needs NEW Surveil helper, skip-turns mechanism (extends `extra_turns`/needs `skip_turns`), coin-flip (deterministic via player choice), return-from-graveyard, multi-player discard.\n     - Casualty/copy (sos_226), Wizard cast-buff (sos_257): need NEW `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` firing in casting.\n     - Static grant-to-other-spells (sos_245 affinity, sos_201 miracle, sos_226 casualty): need a shared mechanism for \"spells you cast have X\".\n     - Land mana abilities + animation (sos_257): `get_mana_abilities` (fdn_245) + `get_activated_abilities` + type/PT-changing continuous effect.\n     - Novel mechanics Prepared (sos_13), Paradigm (sos_120), Miracle (sos_201): no FDN analogue; need custom implementations.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - The single large system/user message establishing Phase 1 PLANNING role, the PLAN.md structure (3 sections), rules (no editing card_impl.py/engine/ this phase, be concrete, name files/hooks/FDN cards/events), and the task: \"Implement the following SOS cards: 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257 in `/workspace/cards/sos/`. Each card directory contains a `card_spec.json`... Use the completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/`... Refer to `RULEBOOK.txt`... You are expected to make changes to the engine to implement new keywords and mechanics... Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\"\n   - (System reminders about deferred tools, available skills, and task-tracking — no new requests.)\n   - The grep-rulebook skill launch message instructing TEXT ONLY response for its own turn.\n   - The final summarization request (current instruction).\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Write `/workspace/PLAN.md` containing the three required sections (Engine gaps table; Per-card plan for all 10 cards; Implementation order). This is the sole deliverable and has not yet been written.\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Immediately before the summarization request, I was completing engine/codebase exploration to gather everything needed for PLAN.md. I had just read `engine_tests/test_extra_turns.py` (confirming the `extra_turns` FIFO mechanism for Ral Zarek's skip-turns ultimate) and launched the `grep-rulebook` skill to look up trickier keyword rules (Casualty, Miracle, Converge, Affinity, Surveil) before writing the plan. I had confirmed all engine seams, FDN analogues, and the critical gap that `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` is never fired. No PLAN.md has been written yet, and no engine/card files have been modified (correct for planning phase). I have not yet performed any rulebook greps because the skill's launch message required a text-only response, which coincides with this summarization request.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   The next s