{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hx9rXkFQtHZnzwybHL5uns","type":"tool_result","content":"155\tdef activate_ability(\n156\t    game: GameState,\n157\t    player: Any,  # Player\n158\t    ability: ActivatedAbilityInstance | LoyaltyAbilityInstance,\n159\t) -> None:\n160\t    \"\"\"Activate an ability.\n161\t\n162\t    Pipeline\n163\t    --------\n164\t    1. **Timing check** — mana abilities bypass timing entirely and\n165\t       resolve immediately.  Regular (non-mana) activated abilities\n166\t       can be activated whenever a player has priority (instant speed);\n167\t       priority enforcement is handled externally by\n168\t       ``priority_loop``, not here.  **Only loyalty abilities** carry\n169\t       a sorcery-speed restriction.\n170\t    2. **Pay costs** — invoke the ability's cost callable.  For loyalty\n171\t       abilities, adjust loyalty counters and enforce once-per-turn.\n172\t    3. **Resolve or push to stack** — mana abilities resolve\n173\t       immediately; all other abilities are pushed onto the game stack\n174\t       as :class:`StackObject` instances.\n175\t\n176\t    Parameters:\n177\t        game: The current game state.\n178\t        player: The player activating the ability.\n179\t        ability: The ability to activate (an\n180\t            :class:`ActivatedAbilityInstance` or\n181\t            :class:`LoyaltyAbilityInstance`).\n182\t\n183\t    Raises:\n184\t        AbilityError: If the activation is illegal (timing, cost, or\n185\t            once-per-turn restriction).\n186\t    \"\"\"\n187\t    if isinstance(ability, LoyaltyAbilityInstance):\n188\t        _activate_loyalty_ability(game, player, ability)\n189\t    elif isinstance(ability, ActivatedAbilityInstance):\n190\t        _activate_regular_ability(game, player, ability)\n191\t    else:\n192\t        raise AbilityError(f\"Unknown ability type: {type(ability)}\")\n193\t\n194\t\n195\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n196\t# Internal helpers\n197\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n198\t\n199\tdef _activate_regular_ability(\n200\t    game: GameState,\n201\t    player: Any,\n202\t    ability: ActivatedAbilityInstance,\n203\t) -> None:\n204\t    \"\"\"Activate a regular (non-loyalty) activated ability.\"\"\"\n205\t    # 1. Check \"can't activate\" restriction (e.g. Arrest).\n206\t    if getattr(ability.source, \"_cant_activate\", False):\n207\t        raise AbilityError(\n208\t            \"Cannot activate ability — source's activated abilities are suppressed\"\n209\t        )\n210\t\n211\t    # 2. Pay costs\n212\t    cost_paid = ability.cost(game, ability.source)\n213\t    if not cost_paid:\n214\t        raise AbilityError(\"Cannot activate ability — cost could not be paid\")\n215\t\n216\t    # 3. Resolve or push\n217\t    if ability.is_mana_ability:\n218\t        # Mana abilities resolve immediately without using the stack.\n219\t        ability.effect(game)\n220\t    else:\n221\t        # Push to stack for resolution.\n222\t        stack_obj = StackObject(\n223\t            source=ability.source,\n224\t            controller=player,\n225\t            on_resolve=ability.effect,\n226\t            is_mana_ability=False,\n227\t        )\n228\t        game.stack.push(stack_obj)\n229\t\n230\t\n231\tdef _activate_loyalty_ability(\n232\t    game: GameState,\n233\t    player: Any,\n234\t    ability: LoyaltyAbilityInstance,\n235\t) -> None:\n236\t    \"\"\"Activate a planeswalker loyalty ability.\"\"\"\n237\t    source = ability.source\n238\t\n239\t    # 1. Timing — loyalty abilities are sorcery speed only.\n240\t    if not is_sorcery_speed(game, player):\n241\t        raise AbilityError(\n242\t            \"Cannot activate loyalty ability — sorcery-speed timing not met\"\n243\t        )\n244\t\n245\t    # 2. Once-per-turn restriction.\n246\t    turn_number = getattr(game, \"turn_number\", 0)\n247\t    if _has_activated_loyalty_this_turn(source, turn_number):\n248\t        raise AbilityError(\n249\t            \"Cannot activate loyalty ability — already activated this turn\"\n250\t        )\n251\t\n252\t    # 3. Pay loyalty cost.\n253\t    current_loyalty = getattr(source, \"loyalty\", 0)\n254\t    new_loyalty = current_loyalty + ability.loyalty_cost\n255\t    if new_loyalty < 0:\n256\t        raise AbilityError(\n257\t            f\"Cannot activate loyalty ability — insufficient loyalty \"\n258\t            f\"(have {current_loyalty}, need {-ability.loyalty_cost})\"\n259\t        )\n260\t    source.loyalty = new_loyalty\n261\t\n262\t    # 4. Mark as activated this turn.\n263\t    _mark_loyalty_activated(source, turn_number)\n264\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"acdbccee-58c7-42ed-bbbd-0f2ff960a258","uuid":"e443bc5f-843f-47d4-9ef4-20358037b01b","timestamp":"2026-06-03T20:58:44.748Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/engine/abilities.py","content":"def activate_ability(\n    game: GameState,\n    player: Any,  # Player\n    ability: ActivatedAbilityInstance | LoyaltyAbilityInstance,\n) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Activate an ability.\n\n    Pipeline\n    --------\n    1. **Timing check** — mana abilities bypass timing entirely and\n       resolve immediately.  Regular (non-mana) activated abilities\n       can be activated whenever a player has priority (instant speed);\n       priority enforcement is handled externally by\n       ``priority_loop``, not here.  **Only loyalty abilities** carry\n       a sorcery-speed restriction.\n    2. **Pay costs** — invoke the ability's cost callable.  For loyalty\n       abilities, adjust loyalty counters and enforce once-per-turn.\n    3. **Resolve or push to stack** — mana abilities resolve\n       immediately; all other abilities are pushed onto the game stack\n       as :class:`StackObject` instances.\n\n    Parameters:\n        game: The current game state.\n        player: The player activating the ability.\n        ability: The ability to activate (an\n            :class:`ActivatedAbilityInstance` or\n            :class:`LoyaltyAbilityInstance`).\n\n    Raises:\n        AbilityError: If the activation is illegal (timing, cost, or\n            once-per-turn restriction).\n    \"\"\"\n    if isinstance(ability, LoyaltyAbilityInstance):\n        _activate_loyalty_ability(game, player, ability)\n    elif isinstance(ability, ActivatedAbilityInstance):\n        _activate_regular_ability(game, player, ability)\n    else:\n        raise AbilityError(f\"Unknown ability type: {type(ability)}\")\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Internal helpers\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\ndef _activate_regular_ability(\n    game: GameState,\n    player: Any,\n    ability: ActivatedAbilityInstance,\n) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Activate a regular (non-loyalty) activated ability.\"\"\"\n    # 1. Check \"can't activate\" restriction (e.g. Arrest).\n    if getattr(ability.source, \"_cant_activate\", False):\n        raise AbilityError(\n            \"Cannot activate ability — source's activated abilities are suppressed\"\n        )\n\n    # 2. Pay costs\n    cost_paid = ability.cost(game, ability.source)\n    if not cost_paid:\n        raise AbilityError(\"Cannot activate ability — cost could not be paid\")\n\n    # 3. Resolve or push\n    if ability.is_mana_ability:\n        # Mana abilities resolve immediately without using the stack.\n        ability.effect(game)\n    else:\n        # Push to stack for resolution.\n        stack_obj = StackObject(\n            source=ability.source,\n            controller=player,\n            on_resolve=ability.effect,\n            is_mana_ability=False,\n        )\n        game.stack.push(stack_obj)\n\n\ndef _activate_loyalty_ability(\n    game: GameState,\n    player: Any,\n    ability: LoyaltyAbilityInstance,\n) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Activate a planeswalker loyalty ability.\"\"\"\n    source = ability.source\n\n    # 1. Timing — loyalty abilities are sorcery speed only.\n    if not is_sorcery_speed(game, player):\n        raise AbilityError(\n            \"Cannot activate loyalty ability — sorcery-speed timing not met\"\n        )\n\n    # 2. Once-per-turn restriction.\n    turn_number = getattr(game, \"turn_number\", 0)\n    if _has_activated_loyalty_this_turn(source, turn_number):\n        raise AbilityError(\n            \"Cannot activate loyalty ability — already activated this turn\"\n        )\n\n    # 3. Pay loyalty cost.\n    current_loyalty = getattr(source, \"loyalty\", 0)\n    new_loyalty = current_loyalty + ability.loyalty_cost\n    if new_loyalty < 0:\n        raise AbilityError(\n            f\"Cannot activate loyalty ability — insufficient loyalty \"\n            f\"(have {current_loyalty}, need {-ability.loyalty_cost})\"\n        )\n    source.loyalty = new_loyalty\n\n    # 4. Mark as activated this turn.\n    _mark_loyalty_activated(source, turn_number)\n","numLines":110,"startLine":155,"totalLines":273}}}
